+// sanitizeCodexUnsupportedInternalChatMetadata removes client bookkeeping that
+// the Codex OAuth backend no longer accepts. The mobile/remote-turn client can
+// attach content_token_count beside turn_id; preserving turn_id keeps the
+// collaboration/session correlation intact while dropping only the rejected
