+	// response.metadata carries moderation metadata only. A request the upstream is about to refuse
+	// opens no output item: it sends this at sequence 2 and server_is_overloaded at sequence 3
+	// (live capture 2026-10-21, after pool.28 was deployed), so leaving it out released the stream
+	// before every overload.
+	case "response.created", "response.in_progress", "response.metadata", "codex.rate_limits", "codex.response.metadata":
